{
  "id": "friends-vo-01",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你当朋友的十个人里，大约三个，没把你当朋友。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "你当朋友的十个人里大约三个没把你当朋友",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "01b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你当朋友的十个人里，大约三个，没把你当朋友。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01b.mp3",
      "bytes": 69006,
      "heard": "你当朋友的十个人里大约三个没把你当朋友",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "name": "02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你肯定在想：我的朋友不会。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "你肯定在想我的朋友不會",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "研究者真测过：一门大学课，八十四个人，互相打分。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "03.mp3",
      "bytes": 82798,
      "heard": "研究者偵測过一门大学课84个人互相打分",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.12
    },
    {
      "name": "04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "零到五分，三分以上算朋友。再猜：对方会给我几分？",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "04.mp3",
      "bytes": 86978,
      "heard": "0-5分,3分以上算朋友再猜,對方會給我幾分",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "name": "05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他们当朋友的人里，百分之九十四，都以为是双向的。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "05.mp3",
      "bytes": 74021,
      "heard": "他们当朋友的人里,94%都以为是双相的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "name": "06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "实际上，真双向的，大约只有七成。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "06.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "實際上真雙向的大約只有七成",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "友谊是根绳，你只握得到自己这头。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "07.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "有疑是根神你只握得到自己这头",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "先别委屈：也有人把你当朋友，你没接。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "08.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "先别委屈也有人把你当朋友你没接",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "算上你没接的，全班的绳子，两头都握住的，才百分之五十三。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "09.mp3",
      "bytes": 90740,
      "heard": "算上你沒接的全班的繩子兩頭都握住的才53%",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.6
    },
    {
      "name": "09b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "算上你没接的，全班的绳子，两头都握住的，才百分之五十三。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "09b.mp3",
      "bytes": 90740,
      "heard": "算上你沒接的全班的繩子兩頭都握住的才53%",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 5.6
    },
    {
      "name": "10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "研究者推测：很多单向的友谊，其实是仰望。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "10.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "研究者推測很多丹相的友谊其实是仰望",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "单向还是双向，还关系到谁带得动你。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "11.mp3",
      "bytes": 65244,
      "heard": "單相還是雙相還關係到誰帶的動你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "name": "12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "健身实验里，每人配了搭子：",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "12.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "健身實驗裡每人配了搭子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "双向的搭子，最能带动你；",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "13.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "heard": "雙向的搭子最能帶動你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "name": "14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他把你当朋友，你没有：也有用；",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "14.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "他把你當朋友,你沒有也有用",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你把他当朋友，他没有：测不出效果。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "15.mp3",
      "bytes": 62318,
      "heard": "你把他當朋友他沒有測不出效果",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "name": "16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "所以，别人抛给你的绳，接住。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "16.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "所以别人抛给你的绳接住",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "自己抛出去的，别猜，去问。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "17.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "自己拋出去的也猜去問",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "把这条发给你会打五分的那个人，问他：你给我打几分？",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "18.mp3",
      "bytes": 75275,
      "heard": "把這條發給你會打五分的那個人問他你給我打幾分",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "name": "18b",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "把这条发给你会打五分的那个人，问他：你给我打几分？",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "18b.mp3",
      "bytes": 76529,
      "heard": "把這條發給你會打五分的那個人問他你給我打幾分",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "name": "19",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "只要他回三分以上，这根绳就是双向的。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "19.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "只要它回三分以上這根繩就是雙向的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.68
    }
